    "x1": 25670,
    "z1": 16490
   },
   "text": "TICKETS. The window's smashed in. Claw marks on the boards."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 21930,
    "z0": 9860,
    "x1": 24990,
    "z1": 11900
   },
   "text": "A handcart of sacks. SPENCER ESTATE.\nFertiliser, rat poison, chain."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 30940,
    "z0": 13430,
    "x1": 32300,
    "z1": 15300
   },
   "text": "ICE COLD. It still works, after all this."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12750,
    "z0": 11050,
    "x1": 15470,
    "z1": 12410
   },
   "text": "A dog's leash, chewed through."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 30940,
    "z0": 6120,
    "x1": 32300,
    "z1": 8160
   },
   "text": "The office window's been broken in. From outside."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 24650,
    "z0": 3060,
    "x1": 26690,
    "z1": 5100
   },
   "text": "The flag's still up. Nobody took it down for the night."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 4590,
    "z0": 12580,
    "x1": 6630,
    "z1": 13940
   },
   "text": "A child's shoe, set on the post.\nSomeone found it in the lane and left it where it'd be seen."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 2210,
    "z0": 17000,
